BT /F2 13 Tf 72 720 Td (4. Audit and Monitoring Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 700 Td (All AI data access events must be captured in the system.access.audit table. The AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 687 Td (Governance team must review audit logs weekly for anomalous access patterns, unauthorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 674 Td (access attempts, and policy violations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 651 Td (Model serving endpoint usage must be monitored via system.serving.endpoint_usage. Alerts must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 638 Td (be configured for: \(a\) More than 100 failed requests per hour from a single requester, \(b\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 625 Td (Access from unrecognized IP addresses, \(c\) Token consumption exceeding 10x the 30-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 612 Td (average, \(d\) Any access to endpoints during maintenance windows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 589 Td (The AI Governance Dashboard application must be used as the primary monitoring interface. All) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 576 Td (stakeholders must have access to the dashboard and Genie room for self-service query) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 563 Td (capabilities.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 530 Td (5. Data Retention and Deletion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 510 Td (AI inference logs containing input/output data must be retained for 90 days for audit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 497 Td (purposes and then automatically purged. Model training datasets must follow the retention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 484 Td (schedule defined by MT&T's Enterprise Data Retention Policy \(EDRP-2025\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 461 Td (When a model serving endpoint is decommissioned, all associated inference tables, vector) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 448 Td (search indexes, and cached embeddings must be deleted within 30 days. The AI Governance team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 435 Td (must verify deletion through the v_underutilized_endpoints view.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 402 Td (6. Compliance and Enforcement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 382 Td (Violations of this policy will be reported to the Chief Data Officer and may result in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 369 Td (immediate revocation of AI platform access. Repeat violations may result in disciplinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 356 Td (action as outlined in MT&T's Code of Conduct.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 333 Td (Annual compliance audits will be conducted by the Internal Audit team using the AI Access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 320 Td (Audit view \(v_ai_access_audit\) to verify adherence to access control requirements. Findings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 307 Td (must be remediated within 30 business days.) Tj ET
endstream
